From: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:59:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] [ROCm][Inkling2] Loop ops for the AMD package: blend
 norms and fp32 AttnRes mixes

- amd/ops/loop.py: pair_rms_norm / blend_rms_norm Triton kernels ported
  from upstream vllm/models/inkling2/nvidia/ops/loop.py (PR #69028,
  Apache-2.0). The PTX rsqrt inline asm is replaced by tl.rsqrt so the
  kernels build for gfx12/gfx9.
- amd/ops/attn_res.py: APPLY_NORM constexpr. norm_weight=None returns the
  fp32 mixes without the RMSNorm (the loop message path needs this), and
  zero-token calls return early. Original AEON change.

Signed-off-by: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
